PROJECT OVERVIEW
The RAG Laptop Shopping Assistant is a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system 
that enables users to query an offline laptop database through a conversational 
interface. It demonstrates how AI-driven retrieval and transparency can enhance 
e-commerce product search without relying on cloud APIs. The system is designed 
for privacy, accuracy, and explainability.

Architecture: FastAPI backend, React (Vite) frontend, LangChain and Chroma VectorDB
Embedding Model: MXBAI-Embed-Large (Ollama)
Local LLM: Llama 3.2
